{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:KnotsParticlesConfinement.CemeteryGroup","@type":"LeanModule","name":"KnotsParticlesConfinement.CemeteryGroup","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroup.not_forall_zero_not_in_cemetery_unconstrained","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroup.not_forall_zero_not_in_cemetery_unconstrained","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/cemetery-group.lean#L54-L60","doc":"**The former axiom `zero_not_in_cemetery` was false** (removed\n2026-11-15). Stated over every `CemeteryGroup`, it ignored that\n`inCemetery` was a free field: the structure with `inCemetery := fun _ =>\nTrue` refutes it. The convention is now the field of the same name. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroup.zero_not_in_cemetery","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroup.zero_not_in_cemetery","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/cemetery-group.lean#L50-L50","doc":"The trivial state (zero index) is by convention not in the cemetery\ngroup: it is the unit of the algebra. Carried as a field since\n2026-11-15; it was previously an axiom quantified over every\n`CemeteryGroup`, which made it false (see below). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroup.inCemetery","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroup.inCemetery","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/cemetery-group.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Predicate: a state index `i` lies in the cemetery group iff its\nKLR lift has vanishing graded Euler characteristic. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroup.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroup.q","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/cemetery-group.lean#L41-L41","doc":"Substrate parameter. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroup.nStrands","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroup.nStrands","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/cemetery-group.lean#L39-L39","doc":"Number of braid strands `n` of the ambient `H_n(R, q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroup.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroup.mk","kind":"ctor","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/cemetery-group.lean#L37-L37","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroup","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroup","kind":"structure","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/cemetery-group.lean#L28-L50","doc":"**Cemetery group** of `H_n(R, q)`: the localising Serre subcategory\nof graded projective KLR modules annihilated by the observation\nfunctor τ.\n\nThis is a light axiomatic wrapper — the KLR/Hecke equivalence used to\nrealise the cemetery group concretely is the Brundan–Kleshchev\nisomorphism, which is not yet formalised in Mathlib. The structure\nrecords the data needed by downstream blocks (the strand count, the\nsubstrate parameter, and the predicate witnessing membership). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:cemetery-group","label":"def:cemetery-group","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/cemetery-group.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}